From 460c48eaaa991159334482d97a063e4c5193f8d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gogo <gogo@bluedynamics.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 11:43:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add speed-over-physics options for heavy traffic

- blob_collisions: false (config) puts all blobs in one chipmunk group
  so they don't collide with each other; while bouncing is off they get
  no collision shape at all. Physics per frame at 4000 blobs drops from
  ~34 ms to ~0.1 ms (shape-less) or ~16 ms (bouncing on).
- max_blobs: N caps blobs in flight, measured from the previous frame's
  drawn activities; requests over the cap still count in the columns.
- --fast enables both (max 2000); 'c' toggles collisions at runtime.
- Defaults unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013kYwHzrj5ef427USqzf3UF
